These audit-only adaptations retain the SDCC library notices below. They are
not linked into the production ROM. Modifications in this repository: RGBDS
syntax and labels, sangoku ABI wrappers, divide-by-zero RST $10 policy,
BC quotient/HL remainder core outputs, SM83 instruction substitutions, and
use of C to preserve A around the wide 16-bit subtraction in sdcc-z80.asm.
The complete GPL version 2 text is in COPYING. The upstream additional
exception is reproduced as written below.

sdcc-sm83.asm: adapted from device/lib/sm83/divint.s (.divu16).
sdcc-z80.asm: adapted from device/lib/z80-common/divunsigned.s (__divu16).
Both sources are from SDCC SVN working-copy revision 17147.

